{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-18_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-18","title":"血潮翻湧","storyCode":"13-20","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-18_end.txt","sourceHash":"5783ccadbe05477d2a76e6c699e53433c0454538aebe36f6a5fb0f684a6339d5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無趣的行為。\n你以為這可以激怒我，這可以侮辱我？\n你以為我會氣急敗壞地踹開你的屍體，大罵你的僭越？\n我不會，萊托。勒內·萊托。\n微不足道的人啊……一如我眼中的這片大地，令人膩煩。\n你以為你的所作所為，可以賦予你可悲的一生以意義？\n你還是這麼自視甚高，萊托。\n我不會為你停留，哪怕一瞬的目光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g1_shard_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的印象沒錯的話，我在你那虛偽的“軍事委員會”裡，似乎也有個職務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你是不是已經很久沒有送戰報給我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"是你太久沒有出席軍事委員會的相關會議了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直擁有相應的指揮權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“指揮權”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要指揮我的子嗣們，他們天生就歸於我，歸於他們侍奉的王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你需要更好地看管他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭的終局已經臨近，你的部屬需要發揮更重要的作用，他們的肆意妄為讓我厭煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"西線戰場花費了太多時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是儀式的需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有足夠的血與淚，我們又怎麼能累積這麼多的巫術材料呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和特蕾西婭向我聲稱，你們找到了那一扇遍結瘡痂的、古老的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲苦難的源頭，命運的起點，真的就在那扇門之後嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"儀式的準備已經完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"但其中的一個節點，那座叫布倫特伍德的鎮子，正在被我們的敵人進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在指派我為你解決這些小麻煩嗎，特雷西斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，您倒是提醒我了，軍事委員會德高望重的“攝政王”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然軍事委員會記得那麼一個“關鍵”的城鎮，為何並無像樣的布防？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裹纏屍布的術師，骨肉傀儡，或是隨便什麼巫術加持、揮舞皮肉的莽漢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我縱容你和你的妹妹，因你們的靈魂強大耀眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軟弱的薩卡茲會稱呼你為攝政王，赦罪師們簇擁在你的身邊，還為你帶回了特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攝政王，死而復歸的“魔王”，你們是一對有趣的兄妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，這都是因為，你們的舉止、力量，而不是你的……“地位”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"“力量”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了降下最宏偉的詛咒，我已在這片戰場上布下賜福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為最古老的王庭之一，我仁慈地喚起薩卡茲們血脈中本就潛藏的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，特雷西斯，你感受到了嗎？你為我的恩賜而喜悅嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你那駁雜的血液中，又能被瀝起幾分力量呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"終局將近，讓你心浮氣躁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"藏好你的弱點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，你需要一些提醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會為你完成儀式的最後一部分，高傲的攝政王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不是為了你們兄妹那狹小的雄心壯志，你們總是盯著那座擁有卡茲戴爾虛名的移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只算得上痛楚的長河中的又一個歇腳處罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"這座碎片大廈也將發揮出維多利亞永遠也預想不到的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那具骸骨正在城外軍營下的樞紐中等待，你可以從那裡前往布倫特伍德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……令人興奮，不是嗎？特雷西斯，你總是這麼一張了無生氣的面孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經看見了。從地平線那頭騰起的黑色光芒，像是一堵黑曜石牆，終將堆砌真正的城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵。你笑我急躁，可沉默不正是你遮掩內心的最佳手段嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願我還來得及回來，目睹那番盛況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你真的能找回那種足以重塑這片大地的偉力，薩卡茲最初接觸到的……“源石”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我會為你，把卡茲戴爾的名號，鋪滿我將觸及的每片土地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲，我的同胞們，背棄自己的過往太久了。\n他們憤恨，他們怨詛，他們將報復施加於我們的敵人之身。\n多麼讓人失望。\n我的同胞們甚至忘記了血脈的來源，忘記了先祖的名諱。\n他們在麻木與悲哀中交媾，誕下一代代醜陋的、混血的子孫。\n他們把自己投入移動城市的陰影之中，藏身於街巷，從侵略者手中乞食。\n我對維多利亞人的血越發失去興致，我對滿足於此的薩卡茲們……則更加怒其不爭。\n薩卡茲自稱薩卡茲的那一刻起，接受了這個“世界”異化他們的那一刻起——\n就讓人怒不可遏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君閣下，巨獸的漂航即將結束，我們很快就會抵達布倫特伍德附近的停靠站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座小鎮已經被維多利亞人攻陷，您的造物也正被他們清掃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……造物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些無智的蟲豸，不過是鮮血王庭的子裔們為晶石塗畫咒文時，無意間灑下的幾滴殘血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓維多利亞人去慶祝他們的“勝利”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我誤會了，抱歉，閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看了眼這位軍事委員會的少校，薩卡茲。\n特雷西斯在他建立的這套系統裡，布置了這麼多遊蕩在王庭之外的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫厄爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是的，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的血液中摻雜了太多酒精，我原諒貪婪與享樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的猶疑，讓人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以為你洗去它們，“少校”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……感謝您的好意，血魔大君閣下，我自己……能處理。我……會盡力改正。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她因緊張而低下頭顱。\n但至少，這些混血兒們還懂得抗爭，這能稍微彌補他們的愚昧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉……厄爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竊取時間的厄爾蘇拉。家喻戶曉的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“厄爾蘇拉”居然挽起了這具骸骨的韁繩，小小的風趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，這只是個巧合。我在為自己起名時，從未料到會真的如英雄一般——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉是個懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他甚至無法直視這隻巨獸的雙眼，只敢躲藏在它激起的亂流中，搖醒幾個沉溺於幻象的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我派給了他這樣的任務，當然了，“拯救了很多人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空洞的呢喃聲傳來，迴盪在整個空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你終於認出我了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片死寂。\n它的智識早已被剝離，如今剩下的只不過是個徒留反應的空殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君閣下，我們即將抵達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能會有一些幻覺——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必提醒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與它曾打的交道，遠比你多得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"灰白色的卡茲戴爾被炎魔葬送。\n焚跡碾過所有氏族的營帳。\n我能聽見火焰的怒吼，我能聽見火焰的哀慟。\n為什麼我們還在屈服！為什麼我們還在懦弱！\n你們這就滿足了嗎？\n你們這就滿足了嗎？！\n那我，就代替你們——\n廢墟中，古老的同胞跪地哭泣。\n魔王死了。\n魔王殺死了魔王。\n我知道他不過是漣漪中的幻象。\n我知道這就是我們不可改寫的歷史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）你們費盡心血地建起了這座灰白色的卡茲戴爾，薩卡茲再一次擁有了家園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）可你們不曾為它的狹小憤怒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）異族的侵略讓提卡茲失去了故鄉。於是，你們開始退讓，你們把代表家園之物一次次縮小、歪曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）直到一片平原，直到一圈圍場，直到你們只敢用它來稱呼自己的城市，自己的村莊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）這是薩卡茲軟弱的起點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）而如今，我將在終點前回望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻境結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這具骸骨已經游回了巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……血魔大君閣下，我有責任提醒您，那支控制了布倫特伍德核心法陣的部隊仍在附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們對骸骨會留下航跡並非一無所知，我們的歸來恐怕已經暴露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的力量不容置疑，但那些敵人中，也許有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的敵人毀壞了儀式的節點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這具骸骨在戰場上投下的那些法陣，本就只是猩紅王庭的觸鬚末端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了，既然已達終末……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就由我親自作為這場最古老的儀式的中心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"朝陽正在升起，透過停靠站上的破損的岩洞，第一縷血色的霞光已經灑下。\n新的一日。\n但這一日，將與以往所有悲哀的日子截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“遠逐者”啊，戴冠的獵手，我們的第一位魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您萬年前的魂靈仍宿於眾魂之中——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"名為碎片大廈的高塔之上，已經累積了足夠的陰雲。\n愚蠢的維多利亞人卻只把這風暴當作可供投擲的長槍。\n多麼淺薄，他們天生敗壞的習性裡，只有爭鬥。\n我閉上眼睛，感受著那些血色晶簇構成的法陣，感受著自這場戰爭以來——不，自我們自貶為薩卡茲以來，所有曾流淌於這片大地上的血液。\n它們因我的垂憐而顫抖，它們因我的呼喚而沸騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您仍然注視著我們，注視著您家園淪喪的後代……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若那些被一次次扭曲、塗抹的渺遠的傳說並非虛假——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請讓那搖籃中的苦難再度降臨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請讓我們……再度尋回提卡茲已失落的命運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一滴鮮血自我的眼眶滑落。\n它流淌於我的臉龐。\n……\n……\n如此遙遠的聲音，它在回應著我。\n我彷彿已經能觸摸到它。\n那扇早已被塵煙埋沒的門扉，正在緩緩鬆動。\n倫蒂尼姆的風暴，正奏響新生的樂章。\n嗯，似乎，還差些什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……如我們所料，維多利亞人正在對這裡發動進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會盡可能地為您爭取完成儀式的時間，血魔大君閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人？呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯，你真是給我留了一個驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不，名叫厄爾蘇拉的姑娘，我們要面對的，可不是什麼“維多利亞人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的客人，確實配得上見證這一刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一位血脈純淨之人，尚且稚幼的喪鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，被篡奪的“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不論是誰，軍事委員會的計劃都必須被貫徹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會加強自己與巨獸的聯繫，竭盡所能阻止他們抵達這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君閣下，請您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒有資格向我提出建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我真想看看——他們這次又會向我吐出什麼陳詞濫調，他們又能向我展示什麼絕望的瞬間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，“少校”，留在這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的這份可有可無的工作，已經結束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這些空洞的骸骨，已經有多少年未曾被填充了？四百年，還是五百年？\n那時，我還未成為鮮血王庭的主人。\n那時，我還能聽見腐爛的戰爭之王傲慢的呢喃，聽見笞心堊主揮向夜幕的拷打。\n那時，哪怕血魔曾與他們敵對，這些翻湧著憎意與信仰的強大的靈魂，仍讓我感到心潮澎湃。\n那時的薩卡茲，已是無家可歸的散亂族群。但那時，我還能看見些許，驕傲靈魂的殘餘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“破滅”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血海吞噬咒言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在玩弄這些可悲的文詞，虛假的咒言，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不去正視那些，真正屬於你的，真正積蓄在你血脈之中的權力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所能唱響的輓歌，現在難道不是應該更動聽了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你卻緘默，你卻，“從不開口”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們到底在試圖與什麼連接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這絕不是任何一種存在於薩卡茲文獻記載中的儀式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正在被喚醒的，那是……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……我看見的，是……一枚“種子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……你們在用萬年前的巫術叫醒它，用戰場上的法陣滋養它，用碎片大廈的風暴駕馭它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這絕不能被允許！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們會徹底毀了倫蒂尼姆！那裡會淪為僅餘源石的廢都！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止如此……這樣的規模，這樣的力量……我甚至能看到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的復仇把整個泰拉拖入深淵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“復仇”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你仍聲稱你是薩卡茲的魔王，可你的觀點卻又是這麼地充斥偏見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩百年前，泰拉諸國的聯軍毀去過一次卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，你覺得，我們將維多利亞的首都獻給痛苦與毀滅，只是為了還擊兩百年前他們對我們的征服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……又一次令人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑王冠仍停留於你的頭頂，這確實是“魔王”做出的，又一件荒唐的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死一個敵人與屠戮一個國家，葬送一座城市與抹去一種文化，這些都沒有區別，對於薩卡茲，這些都遠不足以稱得上反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來到倫蒂尼姆這座異族的首都，也從來不是為了這種“還擊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“種子”？不錯的描述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著那顆種子會帶來什麼樣的光景吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏狹的人是你，血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何一種花言巧語，都無法改變你們所行之事的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說我“從不開口”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你會聽見的，血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“縛結，重枷落於你的軀骸。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漆黑的王冠浮現於異族的頭頂。\n漆黑的長矛貫穿我的肩胛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會，這麼簡單——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，不對！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啊……鮮血湧出。魔王為我裂開了傷口。\n這些是我和我的先祖們，精心傳承了萬年的鮮血。\n我細心地從中揀選著。\n鮮血王庭的歷任主人，都需日復一日，撫去血中哪怕一絲雜質。\n但我們之所以純淨，並不是因為這支血脈未曾失落，未曾受辱。\n而是因為——\n我終於找到它了。\n一滴血。\n歷經萬年時光，傳承至今的——\n提卡茲的血。\n土地為此緘默，河流為此停滯，空氣為此哀鳴。\n整個世界，為此肅穆。\n隨著我伸出的手掌，它緩緩漂浮到了我的身前，並未滴落。\n它只是，向上，向上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想完成儀式的最後一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提卡茲的血寂滅於世界之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！留在倫蒂尼姆的咒文在方才那個剎那崩毀無跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，盡快結束戰鬥，我感到某種——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼匆忙，客人們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液在骸骨之上蠕行——\n血痕於枯朽之中析出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛巧有一個這麼好的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最初的詛咒的見證下——也許我們今日……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還能送別，最後一任“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
